# ForgEd welcome modal (post–account creation)

**Read first:** `docs/prompts/welcome-account-modal.md` — full spec, copy, wireframe, and verification.

## Summary

Build a **one-time modal** (welcome “email” style popup) after successful signup when the user hits the dashboard. Match the **ForgEd metallic brand**: black background, silver/gold, serif headings, tagline **“Learn Skills That Matter.”**

## Brand (required)

- Reference art: `assets/887B4512-18D6-4BD9-81F5-5CD28B58C958-*.png`
- Reuse: `ForgEdLogo`, `ForgEdTagline`, `ForgEdWordmarkText`, CSS vars in `globals.css`, `glass` / `withBasePath("/forged-wordmark.png")`
- **DO NOT** replace or edit `public/forged-icon.png`, `public/forged-wordmark.png`, or `ForgEdLogo.tsx` asset paths

## Trigger

- Set `sessionStorage forged_show_welcome` on signup success (`src/app/signup/page.tsx`)
- Show modal on dashboard (or auth layout); persist dismiss with `localStorage forged_welcome_seen_v1`

## Scope limits

- Do **not** change KODA prompts, Syntrix, CoverIQ, quiz banks, or unrelated pages
- Modal only — no SMTP unless user explicitly asks for real email
